{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/h1yg5f","slideIndex":3,"text":"https://arxiv.org/abs/1910.01108\nhttps://huggingface.co/distilbert/distilbert-base-uncased\nhttps://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/generated/sklearn.feature_extraction.text.TfidfVectorizer.html\nTF-IDF uses training-only vocabulary and IDF. Logistic Regression estimates probabilities. LinearSVC produces margins. DistilBERT uses contextual self-attention and a two-class head. External pretraining prevents an architecture-only causal comparison."}
